  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Identification and formulation of a new Rule of Law programme for Pakistan (AAP 2025)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Purpose of the contract is to support the EU Delegation in Pakistan in identifying and formulating a future rule of law programme for Pakistan. This will be done along two separate but parallel streams: (a) the first and principal objective of a future programme will be to support the development of commercial justice and foster investment climate in the country, with a possible focus on commercial dispute resolution, (b) the second pillar will explore perspectives for a subsequent phase of the abovementioned current action &#xbf;Rule of law support to Pakistan&#xbf;.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
